OL,3,GNEWSAGambling addict swindled council
OL,4,Aout of #7k for rent and Amazon shopping
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gambling addict with previous
OL,7,Fconvictions for fraud and theft
OL,8,Fswindled almost #7,000 from the local
OL,9,Fauthority to pay for online shopping
OL,10,Fand rent.
OL,12,FKaren Deakin, 56, from Haverfordwest,
OL,13,Fwas a purchase card officer for
OL,14,FPembrokeshire council, and was able to
OL,15,Fincrease the limit on employee credit
OL,16,Fcards to spend #6,915.20.
OL,18,FIn sentencing at Swansea Crown Court,
OL,19,FJudge Geraint Walters KC said she had a
OL,20,F"dreadful record of being dishonest"
OL,21,Fand should be "locked up".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
